H1 Find the map of a dotted name once per row. Against include/ of 4e036ed; apply with git apply -p1 in the directory that holds include/.
The compile step gives each var, raw, section and inverted op the id of its first key part in op.e (equal strings in one template have equal ids; at most
kFirstPartIdMax ids; a part with no id has kNoFirstPartId). Walk keeps the value that the first part resolves to, a miss included, for the key
(template, id, generation). The generation goes up at every push and every pop of the stack, so a kept value is used only while the stack is unchanged.
